  "notes": "The recorded frames carry the messages as parts (formatting code, text) and the Java-built lines; test_hudscreens checks the native split line for line. lane/idxclient: the death message and every S02 reach the live chat (chatmsg.c, chatcmd.c; the S02 side part now carries each part's click value and hover beside its code and text, which the row check skips). The chat screen's parts: the sent history (gui_chat.c), the open chat's scroll (play.c: the wheel, PgUp and PgDn, a new line while scrolled moving it one, resetScroll) and its scroll bar (raster_hud.c draw_chat), the component under the pointer (live_chat_piece over chat_split_pieces) for a click and the achievement hover's tooltip, the tab completion's id-1 line replacing the last. idx-chattype-s1, idx-chatsleep-s1 (rows), idx-chatdraw-s1 (the scroll, the bar), idx-chathover-s1 (the hover) within 16 px."
